        "The unit combines a producer-side asynchronous command module with one synchronous card-layout configurator. Its local command ring has 32 entries, each containing one 32-bit command type and five operation-dependent 32-bit payload words, beginning at offset 0x1210 in shared HSD card-service storage. The configurator operates on a CardState and consumes an 18-byte banner and icon descriptor."
